B.Oc=new A.I(B.Rp,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",4,15,10,175,19,B.LP,"\u2022 240 ml sup\u0103 de pui cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare\n\u2022 120 ml ciuperci shiitake feliate, m\u0103surate volumetric \xeentr-un recipient gradat\n\u2022 2 linguri ghimbir proasp\u0103t tocat sau 2 linguri\u021be m\u0103cinat\n\u2022 aprox. 25 g ceap\u0103 verde tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 sos de soia cu sare redus\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei de susan, op\u021bional\n\u2022 340g file de somon, \xeemp\u0103r\u021bit \xeen 4","1. \xcentr-o tigaie ad\xe2nc\u0103 pune supa, ciupercile, ghimbirul, ceapa verde, sosul de soia \u0219i uleiul op\u021bional. Adu la fierbere, apoi fierbe domol 2\u20133 minute.\n2. Adaug\u0103 somonul \u0219i acoper\u0103 etan\u0219. G\u0103te\u0219te la foc mic 4\u20135 minute sau p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd se desface u\u0219or; sursa cere minimum 63\xb0C \xeen interior.\n3. Serve\u0219te fiecare bucat\u0103 cu 60 ml de lichid.","Garnitura de orez este separat\u0103 de varianta de baz\u0103.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/asian-style-steamed-salmon","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, soia; posibil gr\xe2u \xeen sos \u0219i susan dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti uleiul op\u021bional.","",!0,"20.10.2026","Pentru shiitake nu am confirmat un gramaj echivalent pentru felii crude. S-a p\u0103strat volumul sursei, exprimat \xeen ml, \xeen locul unui gramaj ghicit."],t.R)
B.J0=s(["sparanghel","lamaie","maioneza","patrunjel"],t.s)
B.O3=new A.I(B.c3,["echilibrat","Garnituri",4,5,10,39,2,B.J0,"\u2022 20 fire medii de sparanghel, cur\u0103\u021bate\n\u2022 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie, pentru suc \u0219i coaj\u0103\n\u2022 2 linguri maionez\u0103 cu gr\u0103sime redus\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 p\u0103trunjel uscat\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 piper negru\n\u2022 1/16 linguri\u021b\u0103 sare","1. Pune aproximativ 2,5cm de ap\u0103 \xeentr-o oal\u0103 cu co\u0219 de aburi. Adaug\u0103 sparanghelul \xeen co\u0219, acoper\u0103 \u0219i adu la fierbere. Redu focul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te 5\u201310 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 intr\u0103 u\u0219or un cu\u021bit.\n2. Amestec\u0103 sucul \u0219i coaja l\u0103m\xe2ii cu maioneza, p\u0103trunjelul, piperul \u0219i sarea.\n3. Scoate sparanghelul \u0219i distribuie sosul \xeentre cele 4 por\u021bii.","Este o garnitur\u0103, nu un meniu complet.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/asparagus-lemon-sauce","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Maioneza poate con\u021bine ou \u0219i mu\u0219tar; verific\u0103 eticheta.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
B.K6=s(["mar","lamaie","salata","merisoare","nuci","seminte"],t.s)
B.NY=new A.I(B.c3,["echilibrat","Salate",6,10,0,138,3,B.K6,"\u2022 1 m\u0103r Granny Smith cu coaj\u0103, feliat\n\u2022 2 linguri suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 aprox. 180 g salat\u0103 verde cu frunze, sp\u0103lat\u0103 \u0219i t\u0103iat\u0103 lejer\n\u2022 aprox. 60 g meri\u0219oare uscate, ne\xeendesate\n\u2022 aprox. 30 g nuci tocate\n\u2022 aprox. 35 g miez de semin\u021be de floarea-soarelui nes\u0103rat\n\u2022 80 ml vinegret\u0103 de zmeur\u0103 cu gr\u0103sime redus\u0103","1. Strope\u0219te m\u0103rul feliat cu sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie.\n2. Combin\u0103 frunzele, meri\u0219oarele, m\u0103rul, nucile \u0219i semin\u021bele.\n3. Adaug\u0103 vinegreta \u0219i amestec\u0103 u\u0219or. \xcemparte \xeen 6 por\u021bii.","Valorile publicate se refer\u0103 la vinegreta indicat\u0103 \xeen surs\u0103. Un alt sos schimb\u0103 valorile.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/autumn-salad","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Nuci. Verific\u0103 eticheta vinegretei.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
